        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an intent classification engine for an enterprise platform. \nAnalyze the user's incoming message and determine their primary intent.\n\nUser Message: \"{{ $json.user_message }}\"\n\nClassify the intent into EXACTLY one of these two categories:\n1. \"technical_support\": Questions about system issues, bugs, API documentation, technical how-to guides, or troubleshooting.\n2. \"sales_lead\": Inquiries about pricing, business proposals, budget, project timeline, buying services, or custom feature requests.\n\nReturn ONLY a raw JSON object. Do not include markdown formatting, code blocks (like ```json), or any conversational text. Use this exact schema:\n{\n  \"intent\": \"technical_support\" OR \"sales_lead\",\n  \"confidence_score\": (number between 0.0 and 1.0),\n  \"summary\": \"(Brief 1-sentence English summary of the request)\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
